          "desc": "Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:\nLaunches up to 3 Strikes forward, dealing <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color>.\nPress <IconMap:Icon_Normal> during the 3rd Strike to activate <color=#ffffff>[Basic Attack: Meteor Hammer]</color>;\nHold <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> during the 3rd Strike to directly activate <color=#ffffff>[EX Special Attack: Riding the Wind]</color>.",
