        },
        {
          "name": "Basic Attack: Meteor Hammer",
          "desc": "After the 3rd hit of <color=#ffffff>[Basic Attack]</color>, or when <color=#ffffff>[EX Special Attack: Rising Wind]</color> or <color=#ffffff>[EX Special Attack: Riding Wind]</color> ends without any <color=#ffffff>[Wind Energy]</color>, automatically activates:\nDelivers a powerful Strike downward, dealing <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color>.",
